{
 "what": "The lab at speed (timelapse.py): a greedy schedule of every alloy through the route of chapters 1-7, each step on its station, carried by two MiR250 + UR10e units; the atomizer's crucible changed by a person on weekday shifts, everything else round the clock; since round 10 with upkeep.py's maintenance and seeded failures booked into it. A model, not a measurement.",
 "fully_tested": "atomized powder measured (laser diffraction, XRD, XRF, SEM); printed in the 55 mm kit; heat treated; tensile tested at room temperature and at temperature; sectioned, faced, mounted and polished; SEM/EDS, VHX, micro-Vickers, nanoindentation and PIP; a corrosion screen on the CubXL",
